  "description": "The processing request concerns a single NIfTI image, which will be treated as a functional MRI dataset. Accordingly, the measurement type is set to \u201cfunctional,\u201d directing the pipeline to apply the appropriate no\u2011reference quality metrics for time\u2011series data.\n\nThe configuration specifies that all derivative files generated by MRIQC should be retained, while the standard output files are not required. In other words, derivative data will be saved, but the usual output artifacts will be omitted."
